<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher than Monday's close. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    56.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>US 2-4	290-310 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>Sows:  1.50 to mostly 2.00 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3	300-550 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    49.00</p>
</text>
